      "est_runtime_hr": "~2",
      "note": [
        "Deliberately NOT flashing. Front lights are commonly required to be",
        "steady after dark, flashing wrecks your own dark adaptation, and it",
        "removes the speed cue precisely when drivers most need it.",
        "2 hr is ample - this covers a dark first hour, not a whole session."
